  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クロアセラフもクリノセラフも
リチアのお姉さんの
守護機士だったんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Both Chlorseraph and Clinoseraph were Lithia's sister's Mechaknights, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。ヤツらは強力な戦闘タイプ
だったが、機体を制御する
擬似スピリアは安定を欠いていた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Correct. They were incredibly powerful combat types, but the synthetic Spirias they were installed with were unstable.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実戦テストにおいても
ヤツらは暴走し、敵味方の区別なく
破壊の限りをつくした……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even during the testing phase, in battle they would go berserk and wreak havoc on fellow and foes alike...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐぇっ!?
やっぱアイツらって
アブナすぎだよっ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>YIKES! Those guys are insane!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゼロム型思念兵器の成功もあり
不安定なヤツらの
廃棄処分が決定したが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With the success of the Will weapons xerom, it was decided they'd dispose of the unstable prototypes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フローラ様は、あの二体を哀れみ
危険を承知で、ご自分の
守護機士になさったのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, Master Fluora took pity on them, and allowed them to become her Mechaknight, knowing the danger they may bring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>武器そのものであるヤツらに
あえて平和と幸運の象徴
『セラーフ鳥』の名を与えて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She named them, who were themselves weapons, for the "seraph bird", a symbol of peace and good fortune.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……フローラさんは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... so that's what Fluora was like...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フローラさんは……
・優しい人なんだね
・強い人なんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fluora is...
・She sounds like a really kind person
・She sounds strong</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>優しい人なんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She sounds like a really kind person.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むむ……!?　もしかして
セラフたちの剣や盾を
『鳥の翼』に見立てたのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm... OH?! Could their sword and shield kinda be like a bird's wings?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なかなかの芸術的センスの
持ち主とみたよ。
一度、お話してみたかったなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sounds like she had a true artistic spirit. I wish I got to talk to her at least once.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おそらくフローラ様も
オマエたちに会いたかったはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure Master Fluora would wish to meet you as well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>互いにスピリアをつなげあえる
優しい人間たちに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kind-hearted people such as yourself, who can connect with other's Spiria...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>強い人なんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She sounds strong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。フローラ様は
結晶界史上最高の思念術士だ。
その力はクリードに匹敵する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. Master Fluora was one of the most powerful Will mages in the history of Quartzia. Her powers are comparable to Creed's.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>通常戦闘モードのセラフたちが
二体同時にかかったとしても
フローラ様を倒す事は不可能だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if both Seraph's entered combat mode and attacked simultaneously, they would be unable to defeat her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こらこら……
『強い』って、そ〜ゆ〜意味じゃ
ないでしょ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aw c;mon... we didn't mean THAT kinda "strong"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
